# Bowser's back view for Play as (docs/PLAY_AS.md): drawings of the cards our c_koopa_r_pc adds
# (tools/port/bowser_back.py ART), made from his own c_koopa on the player's disc. They follow his own
# drawings and the hammer's in c_koopa_r_pc-.

# his shell from behind, whole: the disc's shell half (its outer side) and its mirror, joined at his
# spine where both are plain green, so there is no seam
image art/models/c_koopa_r_pc/shell.png
  piece r model c_koopa 15
  @r crop 218 158 62 130
  piece l model c_koopa 15
  @l crop 218 158 62 130
  @l flip x
  canvas 124 130
  paste l 0 0
  paste r 62 0
end

# his shell's white rim, straight: a level stretch of the disc's rim (its line, white and line), which
# the card bends round the bottom of the shell
image art/models/c_koopa_r_pc/rim.png
  load model c_koopa 15
  crop 72 303 8 30
end
